<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Online Golf Lesson + Follow-Up | Pure Impact Golf</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Get two personalised online golf lessons with Grant Garrison through CoachNow. Your ball flight, impact conditions and swing guide the Controls for your game. US$99 one-time." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#071725" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://pureimpactgolf.online/" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="One Online Golf Lesson + Follow-Up | Pure Impact Golf" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Two personalised CoachNow golf lessons. Grant assesses your ball flight, impact conditions and swing, then gives you the Controls to guide your changes. US$99 one-time." />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://pureimpactgolf.online/0-impact-banner.jpg" />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#071725;
      --panel:#0d2234;
      --panel2:#12314a;
      --text:#f7f4ec;
      --muted:#b9c5cf;
      --gold:#c8a24a;
      --gold2:#e0b95c;
      --line:#27435a;
      --ink:#06111c;
      --white:#ffffff;
      --max:1080px;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
      background:var(--bg);
      color:var(--text);
      line-height:1.55;
    }
    a{color:inherit}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}
    .topbar{
      position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;
      background:rgba(7,23,37,.95);
      backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .topbar-inner{
      min-height:68px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px
    }
    .brand{font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:14px}
    .brand span{color:var(--gold)}
    .mini-cta,.cta{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
      text-decoration:none;font-weight:900;border-radius:999px;
      background:var(--gold);color:var(--ink);
      transition:.2s ease;
      box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(200,162,74,.22);
    }
    .mini-cta{padding:11px 17px;font-size:14px}
    .cta{padding:17px 26px;font-size:18px;width:100%;max-width:390px}
    .mini-cta:hover,.cta:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);background:var(--gold2)}
    .hero{
      position:relative;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden;
      min-height:min(820px,calc(100vh - 68px));
      display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:112px 0 72px
    }
    .hero::before{
      content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-2;
      background:url('0-impact-banner.jpg') center 42%/cover no-repeat;
      transform:scale(1.01)
    }
    .hero::after{
      content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;
      background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(4,16,27,.97) 0%,rgba(4,16,27,.84) 46%,rgba(4,16,27,.34) 76%,rgba(4,16,27,.22) 100%),linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(7,23,37,.72),transparent 48%)
    }
    .hero .wrap{width:100%}
    .eyebrow{
      color:var(--gold);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em;
      text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:18px
    }
    h1{
      font-size:clamp(44px,8vw,82px);
      line-height:.97;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0 0 24px;
      max-width:900px;
    }
    h1 span{display:block;color:var(--gold)}
    .lead{
      font-size:clamp(19px,2.6vw,27px);
      color:#e2e8ec;max-width:690px;margin:0 0 28px
    }
    .offer{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 16px;align-items:center;margin:0 0 26px}
    .hero .offer{
      width:max-content;max-width:100%;padding:13px 17px;border-radius:14px;
      background:rgba(7,23,37,.72);border:1px solid rgba(224,185,92,.38);
      backdrop-filter:blur(8px)
    }
    .price{font-size:30px;font-weight:950}
    .offer-note{color:var(--muted);font-size:16px}
    .trustline{margin-top:14px;color:#d7e0e6;font-size:14px}
    .trustbar{background:#091c2c;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    .trustbar-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
    .trust-item{padding:24px;text-align:center;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
    .trust-item:last-child{border-right:0}
    .trust-item strong{display:block;color:var(--gold2);font-size:20px;margin-bottom:3px}
    .trust-item span{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .section{padding:82px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
    .kicker{color:var(--gold);font-weight:850;font-size:14px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:12px}
    h2{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,52px);line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 20px}
    .section p{font-size:18px;color:#d3dbd6;max-width:800px}
    .quote{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel2),var(--panel));
      border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;padding:34px;
      font-size:clamp(27px,4.5vw,45px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.08;
      letter-spacing:-.03em
    }
    .quote em{font-style:normal;color:var(--gold)}
    .philosophy-video{max-width:420px;margin:34px auto 0}
    .philosophy-video h3{text-align:center;font-size:22px;margin:0 0 14px}
    .philosophy-video-frame{aspect-ratio:9/16;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;background:#000;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.28)}
    .philosophy-video-frame iframe{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border:0}
    .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:32px}
    .step{
      background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:20px;padding:22px;min-height:190px
    }
    .num{
      width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;
      background:var(--gold);color:var(--ink);font-weight:950;margin-bottom:22px
    }
    .step h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:19px}
    .step p{font-size:15px;margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .fit-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:28px}
    .fit-item{padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:3px solid var(--gold);border-radius:20px;background:var(--panel)}
    .fit-item strong{display:block;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--text)}
    .fit-item span{color:var(--muted)}
    .coach{
      display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:54px;align-items:center
    }
    .coach-visual{position:relative}
    .coach-photo{
      width:100%;display:block;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;
      border-radius:28px;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.3)
    }
    .coach-badge{
      position:absolute;right:-18px;bottom:24px;background:var(--gold);color:var(--ink);
      padding:18px 22px;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 14px 36px rgba(0,0,0,.28)
    }
    .coach-badge strong{display:block;font-size:34px;line-height:1}
    .coach-badge span{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}
    .credentials{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}
    .credential{border:1px solid rgba(200,162,74,.45);color:var(--gold2);padding:9px 13px;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:800}
    .faq details{
      border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px 0
    }
    .faq details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:18px;font-weight:800}
    details p{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:16px}
    .final{
      text-align:center;padding:78px 0 84px;
      background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ead28f,var(--gold));color:var(--ink)
    }
    .final h2{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 20px}
    .final p{margin:0 auto 24px;max-width:690px;color:#263443}
    .final .kicker{color:#49370f}
    .final .offer-note{color:#324252}
    .final .cta{background:var(--bg);color:var(--white);box-shadow:0 12px 34px rgba(7,23,37,.28)}
    .final .cta:hover{background:var(--panel2)}
    footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:28px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .contact{color:var(--gold)}
    @media (max-width:860px){
      .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
      .coach{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .fit-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .coach-visual{max-width:560px}
      .coach-badge{right:18px}
    }
    @media (max-width:600px){
      .hero{min-height:700px;padding:76px 0 46px}
      .hero::before{background-position:58% center}
      .hero::after{background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(4,16,27,.98) 0%,rgba(4,16,27,.84) 54%,rgba(4,16,27,.28) 100%)}
      .section{padding:48px 0}
      .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .step{min-height:0}
      .topbar-inner{min-height:62px}
      .mini-cta{padding:9px 13px;font-size:13px}
      .brand{font-size:12px}
      .quote{padding:26px}
      .trustbar-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .trust-item{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:17px}
      .trust-item:last-child{border-bottom:0}
      .coach-badge{right:12px;bottom:14px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="topbar">
  <div class="wrap topbar-inner">
    <div class="brand">PURE IMPACT <span>GOLF</span></div>
    <a class="mini-cta" href="https://buy.stripe.com/dRm6oHbAi3Dlb8C42A2Fa0q">Book My Lessons</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Personal online golf coaching</div>
      <h1>Understand your ball flight. <span>Get the Controls for your swing.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Grant evaluates your ball flight, impact conditions and swing. Then he gives you the Controls—the specific swing changes that can help you produce the shots you want. Your package includes one online lesson and one follow-up through CoachNow.</p>

      <div class="offer">
        <div class="price">US$99</div>
        <div class="offer-note">One payment · Two lessons · No subscription</div>
      </div>

      <a class="cta" href="https://buy.stripe.com/dRm6oHbAi3Dlb8C42A2Fa0q">GET MY TWO LESSONS</a>
      <div class="trustline">Personal coaching delivered through CoachNow.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="trustbar" aria-label="Coaching credentials">
    <div class="wrap trustbar-grid">
      <div class="trust-item"><strong>Two Lessons</strong><span>One lesson and one follow-up</span></div>
      <div class="trust-item"><strong>CoachNow</strong><span>Personal online coaching</span></div>
      <div class="trust-item"><strong>Your Swing</strong><span>Clear priorities for your game</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="quote">“I evaluate your ball flight, impact conditions and swing. <em>Then I give you the Controls</em> that help you make the right changes.”</div>
      <p style="margin-top:26px">Swing changes are what I call Controls. First, I evaluate your ball flight, impact conditions and swing. Then I give you the Controls that address what is creating your ball flight and help you make the right changes for your game. The goal is not to copy a model swing; it is to understand what your swing needs.</p>

      <div class="philosophy-video">
        <h3>See why I teach Controls</h3>
        <div class="philosophy-video-frame">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/VxVM7Wi8Gig" title="I Don’t Teach a Model Swing. I Teach Controls — Grant Garrison" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fit-list">
        <div class="fit-item"><strong>Your strike changes from day to day</strong><span>You want to know which impact conditions and Controls can improve your contact and ball flight.</span></div>
        <div class="fit-item"><strong>You’ve tried too many golf tips</strong><span>You need one clear priority that applies to your swing right now.</span></div>
        <div class="fit-item"><strong>You want a coach—not another video</strong><span>You’re ready for personal feedback, questions and progress checks.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="kicker">How it works</div>
      <h2>Assessment first. Then the Controls that fit your swing.</h2>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">1</div>
          <h3>Send Your Swing</h3>
          <p>Share your swing videos and tell me what you want to improve.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">2</div>
          <h3>Your Assessment and Controls</h3>
          <p>Grant evaluates your ball flight, impact conditions and swing, then gives you the Controls—the swing changes that can help you produce the shots you want.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">3</div>
          <h3>Practise the Plan</h3>
          <p>Practise your Controls and share an updated swing video through CoachNow.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">4</div>
          <h3>Your Follow-Up Lesson</h3>
          <p>Grant reviews your progress, checks how the Controls are working and gives you the next adjustment or practice priority.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">5</div>
          <h3>Keep Moving Forward</h3>
          <p>Understand why you are making the changes and know what to work on next.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap coach">
      <div class="coach-visual">
        <img class="coach-photo" src="2-portrait.jpg" alt="Grant Garrison coaching on the golf course" loading="lazy">
        <div class="coach-badge"><strong>40+</strong><span>Years coaching</span></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">Your coach</div>
        <h2>Grant Garrison</h2>
        <p>Every golfer is different. What works for somebody else may not be what your swing needs.</p>
        <p>My job is to evaluate your ball flight, impact conditions and swing, then give you the Controls that make sense for your game. I help you understand the changes and stay on track as you practise.</p>
        <div class="credentials">
          <span class="credential">PGA Professional</span>
          <span class="credential">Personal CoachNow Feedback</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section faq">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="kicker">Questions</div>
      <h2>Before you start</h2>

      <details>
        <summary>What is included?</summary>
        <p>You get one personalised online lesson and one follow-up lesson through CoachNow. Your coaching starts with an evaluation of your ball flight, impact conditions and swing. Grant then gives you the Controls that can help you make the right changes.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Is this a subscription?</summary>
        <p>No. It is one US$99 payment for two lessons. There is no automatic renewal.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>How does CoachNow work?</summary>
        <p>CoachNow is where you and Grant share swing videos and coaching feedback for your online lessons.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Do I need to have a good golf swing already?</summary>
        <p>No. Grant evaluates the swing you have today and tailors your Controls to your ball flight and impact conditions.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>When do I have my follow-up lesson?</summary>
        <p>After your first lesson, practise your Controls and send an updated swing video through CoachNow. Grant will review your progress and provide your follow-up lesson.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Do I need to be an experienced golfer?</summary>
        <p>No. The assessment and Controls are tailored to your current swing and the shots you want to improve.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="final">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="kicker">Two personalised CoachNow lessons</div>
      <h2>Ready to understand your ball flight and get your Controls?</h2>
      <p>Get your swing evaluated, receive the Controls for your game, then check your progress in a follow-up lesson through CoachNow.</p>
      <div class="offer" style="justify-content:center">
        <div class="price">US$99</div>
        <div class="offer-note">One payment · Two lessons · No subscription</div>
      </div>
      <a class="cta" href="https://buy.stripe.com/dRm6oHbAi3Dlb8C42A2Fa0q">GET MY TWO LESSONS</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>© 2026 Pure Impact Golf · Grant Garrison PGA</div>
    <div style="margin-top:8px">Questions? <a class="contact" href="mailto:contact@pureimpactgolf.online">contact@pureimpactgolf.online</a></div>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
